    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a42">

                <pb facs="0572" n="522" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg522"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 42.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Ayres</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic">April 17,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">President of Ministers,
                    Lisbon:</hi></p>
                <p>Physicians declare that if Santos Abren, who is sick, goes to sea he will die on
                    the way. Could your excellency permit him to remain a prisoner on board corvette
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Mindello?</hi> The minister of Brazil in Uruguay
                    himself asks this. I believe it would not be improper.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Faria.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
